# .cnw/config.json is project config, safe to commit - these are not.
# **/ prefix is required - a project's .cnw/ can be nested anywhere
# (e.g. mcp/.cnw/ for this repo's own dogfooding link), and a bare
# "dir/file" pattern is anchored to the repo root, not recursive.
**/.cnw/session.json
**/.cnw/staging.json
**/.cnw/cache.json
